es axon guidance and homophilic and heterophilic cell-cell adhesion (PubMed:21724987). May function as a cellular signal transducer (PubMed:21724987). [Isoform 2]: Acts as a ligand of the ADGRL1 receptor. Mediates axon guidance and heterophilic cell-cell adhesion. [Ten-2 intracellular domain]: Induces gene transcription inhibition."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}